      <p><p>The bibliographic catalogue &ldquo;Sources&rdquo; is comprised of travel accounts whose illustrations form part of Travelogues website. In addition, another 2.000 travel works have been researched. Many of these editions constitute major historical resources, yet they do not include significant graphic materials.</p></p>
 
